{"id":"memorial_101604","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101600","label":"Memoirs · A Doctor's Memoir"},"label":"December 8, XX.","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_101603","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101604_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_16_04_description","text":"The last patient died today."},{"id":"memorial_101604_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_16_04_description","text":"Now that they're all gone, there's nothing I can do now."},{"id":"memorial_101604_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_16_04_description","text":"When I'm by my lonesome, my mind goes to bad places."},{"id":"memorial_101604_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_16_04_description","text":"I'm famished. When was the last time I ate...?"},{"id":"memorial_101604_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_16_04_description","text":"At a glance, scalpels and dead patients surround me."},{"id":"memorial_101604_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_16_04_description","text":"Slowly, my mind wanders into the abyss. I was supposed to save these people."},{"id":"memorial_101604_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_16_04_description","text":"I feel like I'm losing my grip on reality."},{"id":"memorial_101604_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_16_04_description","text":"I hope and pray for someone, anyone, to come to the hospital"},{"id":"memorial_101604_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_16_04_description","text":"before my sanity leaves me."}]}